                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to comedy, as a literary genre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc13bcb9-64a4-4717-a148-b1f2ff59ddf5",
                                                "sense_id": "c0514744-dc10-3be0-8e63-d3c01c3769cc",
                                                "text": "comic genius"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98657ddc-9286-4ce5-a58b-7bdc0f989d34",
                                                "sense_id": "c0514744-dc10-3be0-8e63-d3c01c3769cc",
                                                "text": "a comic stereotype"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "936c04b8-5c36-3418-a9fc-6d40d1d7b4e3",
                                        "entry_id": "abbd48d8-2826-3fc4-88d1-e8a0055ae867",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Using the techniques of comedy, as a composition, performer etc; amusing, entertaining."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32c97d31-aeca-44b7-a481-3d2a45d2fb0f",
                                                "sense_id": "936c04b8-5c36-3418-a9fc-6d40d1d7b4e3",
                                                "text": "There is a quartet of comic musicians, who perform on instruments of an inconceivable bassness […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "847ab206-78b7-3a30-8723-144fd7acc785",
                                        "entry_id": "abbd48d8-2826-3fc4-88d1-e8a0055ae867",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unintentionally humorous; amusing, ridiculous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f96622d-0d99-49fb-8802-2fc370d70e28",
                                                "sense_id": "847ab206-78b7-3a30-8723-144fd7acc785",
                                                "text": "As there was something excessively comique in the distress of the landlord and his wife […], I could not forbear staying a little to be amused with it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
